# An independent set of size 16501 in `C23^(box 4)`

`Jraw` lists 16501 codes of `C23^4`, encoded as in `BaseC23Data`.  It is obtained from the
11466-word union-of-cosets code in `C21^(box 4)` of `BaseC21CosetData` by the coordinatewise
interval expansion

  `0 |-> {0,2}`,  `20 |-> {22,1}`,  `x |-> {x+2}` for `1 <= x <= 19`,

taking every Cartesian choice.  Disjoint cyclic intervals `{a,a+1}` in `ZZ/21` expand to disjoint
intervals in `ZZ/23`, so independence is preserved coordinatewise.  The source words have
`0,1,2,3,4` boundary coordinates `7685, 3232, 512, 36, 1` times respectively, giving
`7685 + 2*3232 + 4*512 + 8*36 + 16 = 16501`.

Membership is word-chunked in `maskW` (4373 words of 64 bits) so that each lookup is O(1).
